-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Version 20261125~sparky9~0 (2026-11-25)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  * Initial release (ORDER 63 and 720, milestone 1): the edition's first run is KDE's own Welcome Center (Plasma
    Welcome), which opens by itself at the first login of a new account (its kded module, LastSeenVersion empty) and not
    again after it
  * Two pages shown first, before KDE's own pages (Plasma Welcome's first-pages folder, plasma-welcome
    6.7.4-1+stereo3d1): Sparky Stereo OS in one screen, with the SparkyOS artwork's four 3D screens as a stereo pair
    (stereo-layer's StereoPicture) and a button that opens Display Configuration; and Point, Then Type, which says that the
    window under the pointer gets the keys, why (Daniel Ramos's words) and where to change it, with a button that opens
    Window Behavior and a drawing of two windows with depth on a 3D screen (stereo-layer's StereoDepth)
  * Breaks sparky-stereo-info (<< 20261125~sparky9~0), whose earlier versions kept the Welcome Center from opening at
    the first login
  * English only in this version; the ten required languages come with the remaining pages
